  "question": {
    "text": "Number of colourless lanthanoid ions among the following is ________\n\\(\\mathrm{Eu}^{3+}, \\mathrm{Lu}^{3+}, \\mathrm{Nd}^{3+}, \\mathrm{La}^{3+}, \\mathrm{Sm}^{3+}\\)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{La}^{+3}-[\\mathrm{Xe}] 4 \\mathrm{f}^0 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Nd}^{+3}-[\\mathrm{Xe}] 4 \\mathrm{f}^3 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Sm}^{+3}-[\\mathrm{Xe}] 4 \\mathrm{f}^5 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Eu}^{+3}-[\\mathrm{Xe}] 4 \\mathrm{f}^6 \\\\\n& \\mathrm{Lu}^{+3}-[\\mathrm{Xe}] 4 \\mathrm{f}^{14}\n\\end{aligned}$\n$\\mathrm{La}^{+3}$ and $\\mathrm{Lu}^{+3}$ do not show any colour because no unpaired electron is present.",
    "image": null
  },
